hen $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\left(e^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{2} e^{x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/answer-fields \"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\"] [:db/ensure \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\"] [:db/add \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/id #uuid \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [:db/add \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/id #uuid \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\"] [:db/add \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/id #uuid \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\"] [:db/add \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/id #uuid \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\"] [:db/add \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/id #uuid \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\"] [:db/add \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\"] [:db/add \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/correct \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [:db/ensure \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/id #uuid \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\"] [:db/add \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3^{x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/answer-fields \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\"] [:db/ensure \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\"] [:db/add \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/id #uuid \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\"] [:db/add \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [:db/add \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/id #uuid \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\"] [:db/add \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/id #uuid \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\"] [:db/add \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\"] [:db/add \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\"] [:db/add \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/correct \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [:db/ensure \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/id #uuid \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\"] [:db/add \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/answer-fields \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\"] [:db/ensure \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\"] [:db/add \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/id #uuid \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\"] [:db/add \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/id #uuid \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\"] [:db/add \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2 \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\"] [:db/add \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/id #uuid \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\"] [:db/add \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/id #uuid \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [:db/add \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [:db/add \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/correct \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [:db/ensure \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/id #uuid \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\"] [:db/add \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2^{x} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/answer-fields \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\"] [:db/ensure \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\"] [:db/add \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/id #uuid \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\"] [:db/add \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/id #uuid \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\"] [:db/add \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [:db/add \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/id #uuid \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\"] [:db/add \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/id #uuid \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\"] [:db/add \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\"] [:db/add \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/correct \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [:db/ensure \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/id #uuid \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\"] [:db/add \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 4$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right)^{3} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 4>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right)^{3} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/answer-fields \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\"] [:db/ensure \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\"] [:db/add \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/id #uuid \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [:db/add \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/id #uuid \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\"] [:db/add \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/id #uuid \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\"] [:db/add \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/id #uuid \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\"] [:db/add \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\"] [:db/add \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\"] [:db/add \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/correct \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [:db/ensure \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/id #uuid \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\"] [:db/add \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3^{x} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/answer-fields \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\"] [:db/ensure \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\"] [:db/add \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/id #uuid \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\"] [:db/add \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/id #uuid \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\"] [:db/add \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/id #uuid \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\"] [:db/add \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/id #uuid \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\"] [:db/add \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/id #uuid \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [:db/add \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [:db/ensure \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [:db/add \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/correct \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [:db/ensure \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/id #uuid \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\"] [:db/add \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/answer-fields \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\"] [:db/ensure \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\"] [:db/add \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [:db/add \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(3^{x} + 4\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\"] [:db/add \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/choices \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [:db/add \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/correct \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [:db/ensure \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/id #uuid \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\"] [:db/add \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\sqrt{3^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 4>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 4>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\sqrt{3^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(3^{x} + 4\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/answer-fields \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\"] [:db/ensure \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\"] [:db/add \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/id #uuid \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [:db/add \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\"] [:db/add \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/choices \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [:db/add \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/correct \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [:db/ensure \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/id #uuid \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\"] [:db/add \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 \\\\cdot 5^{x}}{5^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 \\\\cdot 5^{x}}{5^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/answer-fields \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\"] [:db/ensure \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\"] [:db/add \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/id #uuid \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [:db/add \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|e^{x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\"] [:db/add \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/choices \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [:db/add \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/correct \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [:db/ensure \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/id #uuid \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\"] [:db/add \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|e^{x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/answer-fields \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\"] [:db/ensure \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\"] [:db/add \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/id #uuid \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [:db/add \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\"] [:db/add \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/choices \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [:db/add \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/correct \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [:db/ensure \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/id #uuid \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\"] [:db/add \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\sqrt{e^{2 x} + 1} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 1>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\sqrt{e^{2 x} + 1} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/answer-fields \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\"] [:db/ensure \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\"] [:db/add \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/id #uuid \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [:db/add \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\"] [:db/add \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/choices \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [:db/add \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/correct \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [:db/ensure \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/id #uuid \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\"] [:db/add \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cdot 2^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=2 \\\\sqrt{u}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cdot 2^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/answer-fields \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\"] [:db/ensure \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\"] [:db/add \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/id #uuid \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [:db/add \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\"] [:db/add \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/choices \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [:db/add \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/correct \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [:db/ensure \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/id #uuid \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\"] [:db/add \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=2 \\\\sqrt{u}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/answer-fields \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\"] [:db/ensure \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\"] [:db/add \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [:db/add \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(2^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\"] [:db/add \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/choices \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [:db/add \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/correct \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [:db/ensure \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/id #uuid \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\"] [:db/add \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2^{x} \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2^{x} \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(2^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/answer-fields \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\"] [:db/ensure \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\"] [:db/add \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/id #uuid \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [:db/add \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\"] [:db/add \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/choices \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [:db/add \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/correct \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [:db/ensure \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/id #uuid \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\"] [:db/add \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{5^{x}}{5^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5^{x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{5^{x}}{5^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/answer-fields \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\"] [:db/ensure \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\"] [:db/add \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [:db/add \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\"] [:db/add \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/choices \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [:db/add \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/correct \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [:db/ensure \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/id #uuid \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\"] [:db/add \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{2 x} + 3}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} + 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{2 x} + 3}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/answer-fields \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\"] [:db/ensure \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\"] [:db/add \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/id #uuid \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [:db/add \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\"] [:db/add \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/choices \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [:db/add \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/correct \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [:db/ensure \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/id #uuid \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\"] [:db/add \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x + e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} + 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/answer-fields \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\"] [:db/ensure \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\"] [:db/add \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/id #uuid \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [:db/add \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\"] [:db/add \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/choices \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [:db/add \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/correct \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [:db/ensure \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/id #uuid \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\"] [:db/add \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x} - 8}{- 2 x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x} - 8}{- 2 x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/answer-fields \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\"] [:db/ensure \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\"] [:db/add \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/id #uuid \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [:db/add \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/value \"\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\"] [:db/ensure \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\"] [:db/add \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/choices \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [:db/add \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/correct \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [:db/ensure \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/id #uuid \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\"] [:db/add \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} + 2}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} + 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} + 2}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/answer-fields \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\"] [:db/ensure \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\"] [:db/add \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/id #uuid \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [:db/add \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\"] [:db/add \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/choices \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [:db/add \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/correct \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [:db/ensure \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/id #uuid \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\"] [:db/add \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{e^{2 x} - 1}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{e^{2 x} - 1}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/answer-fields \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\"] [:db/ensure \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\"] [:db/add \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/id #uuid \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [:db/add \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\"] [:db/add \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/choices \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [:db/add \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/correct \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [:db/ensure \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/id #uuid \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\"] [:db/add \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x + e^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} + 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/answer-fields \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\"] [:db/ensure \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\"] [:db/add \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/id #uuid \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [:db/add \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/value \"\\\\ln\\\\left|- x + e^{2 x} + 3\\\\right|\"] [:db/ensure \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\"] [:db/add \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/choices \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [:db/add \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/correct \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [:db/ensure \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/id #uuid \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\"] [:db/add \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} - 1}{- x + e^{2 x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- x + e^{2 x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} - 1}{- x + e^{2 x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\ln\\\\left|- x + e^{2 x} + 3\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/answer-fields \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\"] [:db/ensure \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\"] [:db/add \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/id #uuid \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [:db/add \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [:db/ensure \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\"] [:db/add \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/choices \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [:db/add \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/correct \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [:db/ensure \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/id #uuid \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\"] [:db/add \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{2 x} - 4}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [:db/add \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{2 x} - 4}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/answer-fields \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\"] [:db/ensure \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"1bb5b080-02ed-53d0-9c21-df4dc94dc39a\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/88/8855aab63f720970b468fc10b82c80953d8f46b63633982eeddd6537953843a6/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186184351 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"5f9187f5-22ec-5e13-b86a-998e6cfcb208\" :answer/id #uuid \"5f9187f5-22ec-5e13-b86a-998e6cfcb208\"] [\"5f9187f5-22ec-5e13-b86a-998e6cfcb208\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5f9187f5-22ec-5e13-b86a-998e6cfcb208\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1c95dfe4-db81-5259-aa60-815421fbd377\" :answer/id #uuid \"1c95dfe4-db81-5259-aa60-815421fbd377\"] [\"1c95dfe4-db81-5259-aa60-815421fbd377\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1c95dfe4-db81-5259-aa60-815421fbd377\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2 \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"f3397fd6-64bf-5ecf-911a-8e5aba594a85\" :answer/id #uuid \"f3397fd6-64bf-5ecf-911a-8e5aba594a85\"] [\"f3397fd6-64bf-5ecf-911a-8e5aba594a85\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f3397fd6-64bf-5ecf-911a-8e5aba594a85\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\" :answer/id #uuid \"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\"] [\"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"53c7c3e1-48cd-50d6-98b7-0913f873b41d\" :answer/id #uuid \"53c7c3e1-48cd-50d6-98b7-0913f873b41d\"] [\"53c7c3e1-48cd-50d6-98b7-0913f873b41d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"53c7c3e1-48cd-50d6-98b7-0913f873b41d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/choices \"5f9187f5-22ec-5e13-b86a-998e6cfcb208\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/choices \"1c95dfe4-db81-5259-aa60-815421fbd377\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/choices \"f3397fd6-64bf-5ecf-911a-8e5aba594a85\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/choices \"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/choices \"53c7c3e1-48cd-50d6-98b7-0913f873b41d\"] [\"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\" :answer-field/correct \"5102527f-8dc0-5dd6-a34d-b228066149de\"] [\"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\" :question/id #uuid \"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\"] [\"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2^{x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\" :question/answer-fields \"9c9260c8-ddb4-529f-afa3-95f155a1d130\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"5196a682-3b3b-548b-8bcb-d71c48d9fec1\"] [\"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\" :answer/id #uuid \"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\"] [\"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"03291e69-301a-5e36-a8ee-5af9f62b63b0\" :answer/id #uuid \"03291e69-301a-5e36-a8ee-5af9f62b63b0\"] [\"03291e69-301a-5e36-a8ee-5af9f62b63b0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"03291e69-301a-5e36-a8ee-5af9f62b63b0\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"daf8c088-8328-59ff-bd2d-7625b285ab5c\" :answer/id #uuid \"daf8c088-8328-59ff-bd2d-7625b285ab5c\"] [\"daf8c088-8328-59ff-bd2d-7625b285ab5c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"daf8c088-8328-59ff-bd2d-7625b285ab5c\" :answer/value \"9\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4f9eeb44-05c8-5aa5-876d-8e0b4c3f60dc\" :answer/id #uuid \"4f9eeb44-05c8-5aa5-876d-8e0b4c3f60dc\"] [\"4f9eeb44-05c8-5aa5-876d-8e0b4c3f60dc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4f9eeb44-05c8-5aa5-876d-8e0b4c3f60dc\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"a95a2c34-08d0-5e7e-b641-1671402e4b65\" :answer/id #uuid \"a95a2c34-08d0-5e7e-b641-1671402e4b65\"] [\"a95a2c34-08d0-5e7e-b641-1671402e4b65\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a95a2c34-08d0-5e7e-b641-1671402e4b65\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/choices \"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/choices \"03291e69-301a-5e36-a8ee-5af9f62b63b0\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/choices \"daf8c088-8328-59ff-bd2d-7625b285ab5c\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/choices \"4f9eeb44-05c8-5aa5-876d-8e0b4c3f60dc\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/choices \"a95a2c34-08d0-5e7e-b641-1671402e4b65\"] [\"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\" :answer-field/correct \"1b356308-7f73-522c-8bcd-159b18b21749\"] [\"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/id #uuid \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\"] [\"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{x} + 3$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\left(e^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{2} e^{x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\left(e^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{2} e^{x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\" :question/answer-fields \"570bf4fa-e98a-5c46-804b-259fdbb167a9\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"37076561-9cc7-54e0-b6a6-f12582ef2576\"] [\"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/id #uuid \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [\"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/id #uuid \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\"] [\"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/id #uuid \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\"] [\"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/id #uuid \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\"] [\"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/id #uuid \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\"] [\"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"357be9f6-28af-514e-bf35-46ec344268c4\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"8a39baf6-7ace-54f9-8881-c10507bd3782\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"406631ca-87e3-5641-9550-b02c7363333e\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/choices \"0b54f5fb-03d0-5484-83f6-fa79c875ba8b\"] [\"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\" :answer-field/correct \"d476efcc-72c6-5e8a-9aae-2e28144faf04\"] [\"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/id #uuid \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\"] [\"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3^{x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 2\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\" :question/answer-fields \"030a6517-a740-55b4-bc0a-8e71e55423ed\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"d122d325-dd4e-5e3c-9bf4-42390c0e7f21\"] [\"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/id #uuid \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\"] [\"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [\"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/id #uuid \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\"] [\"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/id #uuid \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\"] [\"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/id #uuid \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\"] [\"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"cef139c2-af29-569f-97d3-211d93d5fac5\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"b88134a9-93b2-53fd-add6-da3c8df3ac13\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"acbdbbf0-0d6c-5391-b6a4-3aee96bd807f\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/choices \"b3991143-d38e-53c7-8a27-5d190666569b\"] [\"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\" :answer-field/correct \"eadcf2e6-93d0-589d-91c6-e568dc71f1b4\"] [\"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/id #uuid \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\"] [\"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\" :question/answer-fields \"178e5483-12e9-5478-82dc-be7ebb32cefe\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"0f15d446-4d46-574b-861e-a957a2536c10\"] [\"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/id #uuid \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\"] [\"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/id #uuid \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\"] [\"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2 \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/id #uuid \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\"] [\"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{9}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/id #uuid \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\"] [\"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/id #uuid \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [\"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"0112c27e-e043-5b29-ad36-2fcf89749094\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"1db2cacd-09b6-5d56-bec4-99b5e44e4bb2\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"4291fb9e-1b8e-5ddc-967f-c0e3b03413b1\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"bfa83503-e282-588c-b247-182a63a0ca9d\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/choices \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [\"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\" :answer-field/correct \"9170ccab-76b1-55f3-97b7-12457409c35e\"] [\"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/id #uuid \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\"] [\"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=2^{x} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 3 \\\\cdot 2^{x} \\\\left(2^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\" :question/answer-fields \"7ef48f89-6555-56a6-8966-c7eb1e61fb14\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"7f1f1976-4597-5cd7-b4eb-0a8b45b14871\"] [\"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/id #uuid \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\"] [\"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/id #uuid \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\"] [\"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [\"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/id #uuid \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\"] [\"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/id #uuid \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\"] [\"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"7d71dfca-38d2-5c28-852d-646dea09301f\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"721a0769-6bac-5940-b57c-f18f3f105970\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"66565b37-6c8e-545e-a73c-b882168b6efe\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/choices \"1221a1b3-47cd-5c09-b449-e6d1c00cfbe6\"] [\"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\" :answer-field/correct \"7af9d7b9-9a79-5235-b715-4dafeac6a7f0\"] [\"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/id #uuid \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\"] [\"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 4$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right)^{3} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 4>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right)^{3} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\" :question/answer-fields \"74724f24-3864-5dbf-9f26-2a473f015706\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"5f6584c0-0c89-55ec-8ed8-15570be602ff\"] [\"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/id #uuid \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [\"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/id #uuid \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\"] [\"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/id #uuid \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\"] [\"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/id #uuid \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\"] [\"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\"] [\"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"3c2773b8-e383-53d3-879a-20d6c9ce3514\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"65115652-80cf-5ac5-a896-87f83940f93d\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"75201187-4fad-5d9f-94e1-23d6add14478\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/choices \"46240bb4-c1fc-5f98-ab19-458fe118c7aa\"] [\"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\" :answer-field/correct \"82e47d65-a005-5d9e-996f-be60450c3190\"] [\"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/id #uuid \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\"] [\"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=3^{x} + 1$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\left(3^{x} + 1\\\\right)^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\n$$\"] [\"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\" :question/answer-fields \"e5f8ec3b-e9b3-592d-b56a-b3ba4f2d56bd\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b179e51d-fde0-5f87-b5e7-b1a25d37beaf\"] [\"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/id #uuid \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\"] [\"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/id #uuid \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\"] [\"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/id #uuid \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\"] [\"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/id #uuid \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\"] [\"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)\"] [\"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/id #uuid \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [\"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\" :answer/value \"\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"c8d86aa4-7bae-5058-8638-babc5b7a040b\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"dd069ab8-e030-5af0-87f0-6bbdb029763b\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"2287504f-e1dc-5e9a-868a-72d547ff8970\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"0ba6f291-bb76-5ba6-a32c-91faf617ea35\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/choices \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [\"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\" :answer-field/correct \"1aec8f7e-eb38-55de-b967-a99fae3472e3\"] [\"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/id #uuid \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\"] [\"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/problem \"Use the substitution $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Which integral is obtained?\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\"] [\"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 2\\\\right)^{2} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nThe transformed integral is\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int u^{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\n$$\"] [\"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [\"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\" :question/answer-fields \"a26b5c34-17e1-5280-8d13-b4e435154956\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"3607a00c-ed00-5182-88fc-30842ad51810\"] [\"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [\"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(3^{x} + 4\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [\"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\"] [\"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/choices \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [\"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\" :answer-field/correct \"ac0a3a05-fdcb-5ea7-8f78-c6250c9aa1d0\"] [\"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/id #uuid \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\"] [\"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\sqrt{3^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 4>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3^{x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $3^{x} + 4>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\cdot 3^{x} \\\\sqrt{3^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(3 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(3^{x} + 4\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\" :question/answer-fields \"a79080ff-3a68-56f4-bd9c-22a0870f1b37\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"0156d36e-072e-5215-9c38-b10ce4b47e6d\"] [\"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/id #uuid \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [\"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\"] [\"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/choices \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [\"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\" :answer-field/correct \"ec0420e0-bc5c-5ba5-bc50-0c2ecb853f02\"] [\"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/id #uuid \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\"] [\"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 \\\\cdot 5^{x}}{5^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 \\\\cdot 5^{x}}{5^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\" :question/answer-fields \"cd09eb4b-c664-50f9-8113-b56c9880d85e\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"eaed86d4-f4ba-55c4-8957-65e72c41413d\"] [\"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/id #uuid \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [\"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|e^{x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\"] [\"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/choices \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [\"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\" :answer-field/correct \"d8ce16e4-e6e9-5770-bd52-c528f41d4c34\"] [\"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/id #uuid \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\"] [\"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x}}{e^{x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|e^{x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\" :question/answer-fields \"e044980f-df8c-5ebc-9aab-7e314954a789\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"234b841b-ddf2-5537-9f3b-c343ab766392\"] [\"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/id #uuid \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [\"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [\"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\"] [\"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/choices \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [\"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\" :answer-field/correct \"3320dec6-8b4f-590e-8dcb-0742047d4bbe\"] [\"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/id #uuid \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\"] [\"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 4 \\\\sqrt{e^{2 x} + 1} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 1>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{2 x} + 1>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 4 \\\\sqrt{e^{2 x} + 1} e^{2 x}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\" :question/answer-fields \"947510be-5291-5029-825b-05037b47652f\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"69d1eec5-81a3-5284-a785-7a97dc40fb64\"] [\"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/id #uuid \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [\"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}\\\\right)\"] [\"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\"] [\"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/choices \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [\"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\" :answer-field/correct \"e180d782-4de4-56af-b422-90495e9d1e10\"] [\"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/id #uuid \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\"] [\"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cdot 2^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=2 \\\\sqrt{u}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 2>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 \\\\cdot 2^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 2}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\" :question/answer-fields \"82cc3620-0ac2-51ea-96d5-046a3c0a3a4f\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"11ef6d40-0a09-58bb-8363-01217a52d0ea\"] [\"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/id #uuid \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [\"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}\\\\right)\"] [\"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\"] [\"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/choices \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [\"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\" :answer-field/correct \"8156d017-3401-5bd3-a0d0-6313ab57906c\"] [\"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/id #uuid \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\"] [\"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=2 \\\\sqrt{u}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $e^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{x}}{\\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(2 \\\\sqrt{e^{x} + 3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\" :question/answer-fields \"396dc548-1d55-579a-8b96-6c2d63e31740\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"79fd7a1c-f80b-5f30-b249-83e9987f33c8\"] [\"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/id #uuid \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [\"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(2^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)\"] [\"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\"] [\"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/choices \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [\"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\" :answer-field/correct \"cc74a0e7-44e2-5fae-a5db-8d69f134f85d\"] [\"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/id #uuid \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\"] [\"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int 2^{x} \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}+C$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork where $2^{x} + 3>0$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int 2^{x} \\\\sqrt{2^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\sqrt{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 u^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(2 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\frac{2 \\\\left(2^{x} + 3\\\\right)^{\\\\frac{3}{2}}}{3}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\" :question/answer-fields \"0db88b23-58cf-5ec3-87d8-e693487a62ba\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"fbe42d09-6935-5167-af4a-642732c52ed7\"] [\"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/id #uuid \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [\"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\"] [\"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/choices \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [\"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\" :answer-field/correct \"6edf7752-6e76-549e-b7f5-cc968d4c1e6b\"] [\"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/id #uuid \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\"] [\"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{5^{x}}{5^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5^{x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5^{x} \\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)})\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{5^{x}}{5^{x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{\\\\ln{\\\\left(5 \\\\right)}}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|5^{x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\" :question/answer-fields \"2670a155-a926-5568-96d3-f75f22455479\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b600485f-2a8a-53d6-9f97-db58335a0f24\"] [\"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/id #uuid \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [\"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\"] [\"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/choices \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [\"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\" :answer-field/correct \"ac2c5013-33bd-5d19-9cc8-c4d9e9a915d2\"] [\"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/id #uuid \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\"] [\"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{2 x} + 3}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} + 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3 e^{2 x} + 3}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\" :question/answer-fields \"8b553907-b58e-5267-8715-e4778af79c9c\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"bc08d550-1e24-59f1-bab8-fa99a8cbf667\"] [\"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/id #uuid \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [\"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\"] [\"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/choices \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [\"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\" :answer-field/correct \"2e228d92-8e66-55f1-83eb-fa5d97e219e1\"] [\"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/id #uuid \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\"] [\"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x + e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} + 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\" :question/answer-fields \"309b896d-0ed4-573b-ae38-151b2a7fd9ba\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"24ac3e9f-c431-5dd9-aaf4-0785964f442b\"] [\"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/id #uuid \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [\"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\"] [\"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/choices \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [\"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\" :answer-field/correct \"389a48de-ba61-5e04-bb93-b02531e55793\"] [\"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/id #uuid \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\"] [\"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x} - 8}{- 2 x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{x} - 8}{- 2 x + e^{x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{x} + 3\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\" :question/answer-fields \"04943376-ec09-5ee8-a026-2717f0edb9fc\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"f17aa6e6-95fe-551d-a18c-b1c22fb1c92f\"] [\"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/id #uuid \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [\"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\" :answer/value \"\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\"] [\"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\"] [\"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/choices \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [\"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\" :answer-field/correct \"6af84686-d09b-5aa3-ae4a-19ceb28d8a0a\"] [\"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/id #uuid \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\"] [\"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} + 2}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x + e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} + 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} + 2}{2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\ln\\\\left|2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\"] [\"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\" :question/answer-fields \"dcf91abd-7972-5cdd-a9d1-a1b544bbffff\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"1fbf42aa-0c2a-5aad-95e1-ee2ce4773cfc\"] [\"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/id #uuid \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [\"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\"] [\"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/choices \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [\"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\" :answer-field/correct \"ef9d19b8-b764-5fc0-89ff-6ac72aea9d00\"] [\"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/id #uuid \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\"] [\"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{e^{2 x} - 1}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{e^{2 x} - 1}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 4\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\" :question/answer-fields \"72c51815-1bd0-5eb5-8b76-2f5b576ed2d6\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"ad79e0bf-30a8-5a5e-8565-5721f911bb72\"] [\"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/id #uuid \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [\"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\"] [\"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/choices \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [\"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\" :answer-field/correct \"efba1585-12c6-5bc3-b452-387ee1d85550\"] [\"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/id #uuid \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\"] [\"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=x + e^{x} + 2$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(e^{x} + 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{x} + 2}{x + e^{x} + 2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|x + e^{x} + 2\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\" :question/answer-fields \"350bf0df-e11e-5e67-a2ef-d167b0009b5b\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"b48f00d3-1d5f-57ce-8193-e35fdb23619c\"] [\"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/id #uuid \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [\"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\" :answer/value \"\\\\ln\\\\left|- x + e^{2 x} + 3\\\\right|\"] [\"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\"] [\"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/choices \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [\"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\" :answer-field/correct \"85ea9013-4282-55bc-946e-30500a65a254\"] [\"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/id #uuid \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\"] [\"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} - 1}{- x + e^{2 x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- x + e^{2 x} + 3$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 1)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2 e^{2 x} - 1}{- x + e^{2 x} + 3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\ln\\\\left|- x + e^{2 x} + 3\\\\right|+C.\\n$$\"] [\"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\" :question/answer-fields \"2aff0ff1-c58a-5dd9-a5c8-c85342df2e78\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"ea1a7e25-e71f-582a-863b-88aa6d9cf7aa\"] [\"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/id #uuid \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [\"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)\"] [\"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\"] [\"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [\"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/choices \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [\"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\" :answer-field/correct \"9fbb508d-92db-5035-8a17-fd24237b638d\"] [\"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/id #uuid \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\"] [\"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{2 x} - 4}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nYou may use $\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|+C$.\\n\\n{{answer}} $+C$\"] [\"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2 e^{2 x} - 2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nUse a connected real interval on which the integrand is defined.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4 e^{2 x} - 4}{- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the supplied primitive:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{u}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|u\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\ln\\\\left|- 2 x + e^{2 x} + 1\\\\right|\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\" :question/answer-fields \"6fc081b0-2f19-5297-9456-fed742bd694e\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/questions \"65cd622a-f56e-5266-8bca-f7152ab8c719\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"1bb5b080-02ed-53d0-9c21-df4dc94dc39a\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/88/8855aab63f720970b468fc10b82c80953d8f46b63633982eeddd6537953843a6/generator.py\"] [17592186184351 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"]] \"retractions\" []}",
